   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LIT301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">British &amp; American Literature — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11340 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LIT301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">British &amp; American Literature — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11340 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">LIT301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">British and American Literature _Văn học Anh - Mỹ</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 1 hour final exam + 104 hours self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">ECR201, EAW221</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Seminar,Workshop,Presenting,Demonstration,Roleplay,Active learning,Cooperative Learning,Discovery Learning,Presentation,Practice</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">11340</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 04/03/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">4/3/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">LIT301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">British and American Literature _Văn học Anh - Mỹ</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 1 hour final exam + 104 hours self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">ECR201, EAW221</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Seminar,Workshop,Presenting,Demonstration,Roleplay,Active learning,Cooperative Learning,Discovery Learning,Presentation,Practice</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">11340</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 04/03/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">4/3/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>1. Objective: Showing knowledge and understanding of classic and modern English and American prose, their social and cultural contexts. Helping students develop emotional literacy and social and cultural understanding.<br><br>2. Description: This module will appeal to students with an interest in exploring the diversity and vibrancy of classic and contemporary American and English literature. Students will be studying a range of engaging English and American texts, from the major genres of social novel, romance novel, detective fiction, and thriller.<br><br>3. Teaching method: lecture and seminar format<br><br>4. Assessment scheme:<br><br>On-going assesment: 70%<br><br>Final examination: 30 %<br><br>Completion Criteria: On-going assessment &gt;0, Final Exam Score &gt;=4/10 &amp; Final Result &gt;=5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>1. Objective: Showing knowledge and understanding of classic and modern English and American prose, their social and cultural contexts. Helping students develop emotional literacy and social and cultural understanding.<br><br>2. Description: This module will appeal to students with an interest in exploring the diversity and vibrancy of classic and contemporary American and English literature. Students will be studying a range of engaging English and American texts, from the major genres of social novel, romance novel, detective fiction, and thriller.<br><br>3. Teaching method: lecture and seminar format<br><br>4. Assessment scheme:<br><br>On-going assesment: 70%<br><br>Final examination: 30 %<br><br>Completion Criteria: On-going assessment &gt;0, Final Exam Score &gt;=4/10 &amp; Final Result &gt;=5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11340\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11340</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11340\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11340</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
